{"title":"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of all the positive solutions of \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b20aaae1edde833f927a00fe5e9cf44e966b04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cos2x \\left(\\cos2x - \\cos{\\left( \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\right) } \\right) = \\cos4x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"371\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09240ffccf2c1f83928589bc70f97e05a500d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\pi \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 810\\pi \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1008\\pi \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1080 \\pi \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1800\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"494\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f937e31cb61aa49be9890a98a7aea67614f830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{4x} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"12\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e69ef92981f41b9eb80a583df9ac2359e34c777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cos^2{2x} - 2$\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />.  Now let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/501d41a8a188ab8042991bdaf32f88489f8e956e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\cos{2x}$\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84ebb38654cb213eca953ad3b94384b408d1aa35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\cos{\\left( \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\right) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"146\" height=\"45\" />.  We have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/8975fcac46468f295fbd0d3333a9455ca2256cac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a(a - b) = 2a^2 - 2\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/0/e002e609f83a150ff5ec4544c0fa03ea099cc517.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab = 1\\]\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Notice that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce67f0e5287f11dc65e3f81673742d580064d9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />.  For the first case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27bae8236f6f2a60c7d6b4468864fe89cc53db56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = k\\pi$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f66a375b1ff3e469e2bc2238ab9d403c6695236f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2014\\pi^2}{k\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"57\" height=\"39\" /> is an even multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6dc62525fec80a874760c5bcb1c011df7904c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014 = 2*19*53$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"139\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/0/280c42c583a937e4274ac58e878525b8566bffb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b =1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is an odd divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/16794ed8d576bcdfc1b48ac2155ce53ff11aff25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.  This gives us these possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e8a96db482d9ff6a871fefac5c8aea486ed03e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x= \\pi, 19\\pi, 53\\pi, 1007\\pi\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"16\" />\nFor the case where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37d275745147cb3de89a06b577eaff5eba272ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2x} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"93\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/566d9c107ecc48514e56b81c127d5d6494c0bb63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{m\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"33\" />, where m is odd.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150fb3e3b1401886aa823e115a95ec441133ef28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2014\\pi^2}{\\frac{m\\pi}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"57\" height=\"45\" /> must also be an odd multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> in order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> to equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/30920cd07525eea9aafbb4aa1e1c91c84d9afdf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4028}{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"38\" height=\"37\" /> must be odd.  We can quickly see that dividing an even number by an odd number will never yield an odd number, so there are no possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, and therefore no cases where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce67f0e5287f11dc65e3f81673742d580064d9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, the sum of all our possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830c1c88ac182221a4c3439f4527d3450356f47a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\pi + 19\\pi + 53\\pi + 1007\\pi = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1080 \\pi}\\]\" width=\"302\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Very similar to the solution above, re-write the expression using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/f/e6f83cfe37b43a59a3eb8ba0d975e8d6d85f8e81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 4x = 2 \\cos^2 2x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1e9f2127f1c61e358f479f24b74d363bcda9a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\cos2x \\left(\\cos2x - \\cos{\\left( \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\right) } \\right) = 2 \\cos^2 2x - 2\\]\" width=\"390\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Now, expand the LHS and cancel terms:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/375069bf90780dc98b36888cee13ae721e1529c1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\cos^2 2x - 2 \\cos 2x \\cos{\\left( \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\right) } = 2 \\cos^2 2x - 2\\]\" width=\"384\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2acc99af2129f31d1abbebd69d9c55e98b6e4751.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos 2x \\cos{\\left( \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\right) } = 1\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Now we use product-to-sum identities to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/1/1911f1da27d94e1ae5a0ca7dc228784e3a33ff95.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2} \\Biggl( \\cos\\Bigl( 2x + \\frac{2014 \\pi^2}{x} \\Bigr) + \\cos\\Bigl( 2x + \\frac{2014 \\pi^2}{x} \\Bigr) \\Biggr) = 1\\]\" width=\"386\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6eee448e267c67444cc4a9b329c63b140f9ab17f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\left(2x + \\left( \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\right) \\right)} = 1\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Notice that for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a35bd1cc8d3ede8474b4d2a0c6cec47771889e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max{\\cos \\theta} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. This is achieved when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/8656595bf44ec840dac700925abe3bcbccab0b46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, or equivalently \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9acc8cca66491363cc1e1c5cbd6ff5b15ade0d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x - \\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x} \\equiv 0 \\mod 2\\pi\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>We can cleverly assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9be3345774f8f8142cb359ef6f776b2c971e86a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=c\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"10\" /> for some real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Then, we must have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca2ca50615b5d0c1c7f3fc2e963a45b3a1864d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2c - \\frac{2014}{c} \\equiv 0 \\mod 2\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>In order for this to be satisfied, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5f7bca0a65dfb1266ccd78d5bf9687437492ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2014}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> must be an even integer. Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d4001de72e4e1d832c9b9e0c6952953802409f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014 = 2 \\cdot 19 \\cdot 53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"134\" height=\"14\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> must be a positive odd integer that divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/16794ed8d576bcdfc1b48ac2155ce53ff11aff25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />. Our only positive valid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7318af8584678ee97318c641c4e1c04b04694b80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1, 19, 53, 1007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"17\" />. Our answer is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387ebbf94191ea24eb2b214d261f9b89c0661067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi(1+19+53+1007) = 1080\\pi \\implies \\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"326\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n-FIREDRAGONMATH16\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewriting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f937e31cb61aa49be9890a98a7aea67614f830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{4x} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"12\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e69ef92981f41b9eb80a583df9ac2359e34c777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cos^2{2x} - 2$\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" /> and transposing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e6870e1a84a1c5073bc643c2be6731259c42f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cos{2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> from the LHS to the RHS, we get,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e98a650128a042b2039f3cc2f7872e860365d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{2x} - \\cos{\\left(\\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x}\\right)} = 1 - \\frac{1}{\\cos{2x}}\\]\" width=\"285\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/9/539032a54855c5ca2f128c9d68ff0bea3abe47c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\underbrace{\\cos{2x} + \\frac{1}{\\cos{2x}}}_{\\text{LHS}} = \\underbrace{1 + \\cos{\\left(\\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x}\\right)}}_{\\text{RHS}}\\]\" width=\"327\" height=\"66\" />\n</p><p>By the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/AM-GM_Inequality\">AM-GM Inequality</a>,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2db3823f9cd5e5e9d3985623dc6bc2cd15ced3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{2x} + \\frac{1}{\\cos{2x}} \\in (-\\infty, -2] \\cup [2, \\infty)\\]\" width=\"283\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Also, because of the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5e108fdc4bf4fb6151cb922992f23bc6c35985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos$\" width=\"24\" height=\"8\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47cbd313aa0f85ead5d6b52cbb35046dfef80a16.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 + \\cos{\\left(\\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x}\\right)} \\in [0, 2]\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/714bb79273f68cea6b21f6f526c42359e97a642f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{LHS} = \\text{RHS} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"125\" height=\"14\" />, and we get (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/21972a987579ebeb325f10881c9bc0e6086fabe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />),\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba30cd6695031fc7936521880f0b24bb3855da48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2x} = 1 \\implies x = m\\pi \\hspace{75pt} \\cdots\\cdots (1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"392\" height=\"20\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/e/8ee5bbadd4cabbaa55f1782d65819a2cea84d477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{\\left(\\frac{2014\\pi^2}{x}\\right)} = 1 \\implies x = \\frac{1007\\pi}{n} \\hspace{22pt} \\cdots\\cdots (2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"394\" height=\"45\" /></li></ul>\n<p><br />\nFrom <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f637ae0d1ca0374c7167089b3a7f1ef9ed99c13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m = \\frac{1007}{n}\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb0ed968a11a491d03e02a86fb8bf2f4c63af05a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies m \\in \\{1, 19, 53, 1007\\}\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/f/f0f420cceef5622474702b07d8c4cfea6d781fac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies x \\in \\{1\\pi, 19\\pi, 53\\pi, 1007\\pi\\}\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, sum of values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57d762d77428d23077f038f0024ddb44f0bfd92.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\pi + 19\\pi + 53\\pi + 1007\\pi = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1080\\pi}\\]\" width=\"302\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Plusone\">plusone</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B\">2014 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12